{"id":10000083,"name":"琳妮特","enName":"Lynette","title":"丽影绮行","element":"风","region":"枫丹","rarity":4,"weapon":"单手剑","birthday":"2月2日","constellation":"白尾猫座","description":"寡言少语，罕有表情的魔术助手，性情像猫一样难以猜测。","affiliation":"布法蒂公馆","cv":{"chinese":"可可味","japanese":"篠原侑","english":"阿奈丽丝·基尼奥内斯","korean":"李瑟琳娜"},"avatarImg":"assets/characters/10000083-avatar.webp","splashArt":"assets/characters/10000083-art.webp","hasLocalPack":false,"voicePackageUrl":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/simon3000/genshin-voice/resolve/main/speaker-archives/Chinese/501-plus/Lynette.zip","voicePackageEn":"Lynette","quoteCount":71,"friendLines":[{"title":"初次见面…","desc":"初次见面，我是林尼的魔术助手，工作事宜请咨询林尼。观看演出请咨询售票处。找我？…请长话短说。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_draw_appear_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/62/rnu6264q3zrd7osbea4mtefx7gwnviv.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·喝茶","desc":"茶泡好了，接下来可以休息一会儿了。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_character_idle_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/16/g03md2lh115wmlpdz4piey4xkjf0oh4.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·哥哥","desc":"林尼好像又在说什么奇怪的话了…真让人放心不下。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_character_idle_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/fa/l68yw5tvcsdjne8zidubd9zq25iohhv.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·发呆","desc":"进入待机模式…希望不要有人来打扰我。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_character_idle_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/99/7054zltq631w0qf222rdcc4lzwrccbz.mp3"},{"title":"下雨的时候…","desc":"雨天适合发呆…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_weather_heavyRain_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/9d/m54f79vwckc31cr9mqqjbjbzyr4776u.mp3"},{"title":"雨过天晴…","desc":"这就天晴了，可惜。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_weather_afterRain_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/a7/rjhqt50d1styljuf0xo36ukyfy1f35f.mp3"},{"title":"打雷的时候…","desc":"唔…耳朵疼。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_weather_thunder_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/61/n5qz49f4a5nzyoazqa2ajjgbbpz1tih.mp3"},{"title":"下雪的时候…","desc":"冷…把你藏到帽子里吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_weather_snowy_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d4/9jha0568xanstimr8lvk3wow0bcv7la.mp3"},{"title":"阳光很好…","desc":"太阳底下没有新鲜事…真是这样吗？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_weather_sunny_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/18/9xrm914tikaxbipywlvrseym0uogdut.mp3"},{"title":"刮大风了…","desc":"风里传来的气息…不，没什么。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_weather_gale_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/25/ahciculp1wgtzn9yumhw72zltl75utd.mp3"},{"title":"早上好…","desc":"早安…充能尚未完成，即将再次休眠。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_dialog_greetingMorning","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/23/5hfyshs7wzy4pmlslk8fgj4uslixv2u.mp3"},{"title":"中午好…","desc":"我习惯工作之前喝一杯茶，能转换心情，也能保持清醒。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_dialog_greetingNoon","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/fe/djry051ix8yrj0tuz5u1ikswncw35sl.mp3"},{"title":"晚上好…","desc":"太阳下山之后，人们内心潜藏的欲望，就会浮上水面…我是说，晚上的演出会很精彩。要给你留票吗？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_dialog_greetingNight","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/0d/jndjem4feasrrz3zjhqu6irxeid8gty.mp3"},{"title":"晚安…","desc":"快睡吧，我还要处理白天没做完的事情…（还要把弄坏的吸尘器修好。）","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_dialog_greetingNight2","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/93/467dlpi68h71s19yicmtnp0ok3p3wl3.mp3"},{"title":"关于琳妮特自己·魔术","desc":"表演的时候，我一般担任林尼的助手，因为一直不说话也不做表情，有人以为我是魔术人偶…这种误解能避免不必要的交际，倒也不错。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_dialog_idle","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/38/9zbsjr3y1tfq7lnnnqecawv2b5e32yk.mp3"},{"title":"关于琳妮特自己·情报","desc":"沉默有助于集中精神，看清有用情报。曾经来看演出的某位贵客，掏出了不属于他太太的手帕…至于情报的具体用途，嗯…就看那位大人的意思了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_dialog_idle2","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/81/i52u466pdmjd6ohzj2hiibyp3jcldo0.mp3"},{"title":"关于我们·倾听","desc":"我不习惯主动表达，但应该算是个不错的听众。如果有什么烦恼，就来找我吧。我会为你保密。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_dialog_close","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/af/p4lnwu6js4mwo85jcvnwk5zl70oflcy.mp3"},{"title":"关于我们·兴趣","desc":"我曾经以为，金色的「太阳」和夜色的「暗影」，是无法互相理解的，可你身上有着奇特的复杂性，让我产生了不必要的好奇心…今后也让我继续观察你吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_dialog_close1","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f2/sxdraz4suzcnjqdnu8qwz8jg0akan0t.mp3"},{"title":"关于「神之眼」…","desc":"比起武力，我更喜欢用自己的眼睛掌握现状，找到合适的解决方法。不过，拥有力量就会拥有更多底牌，就能在危急情况下保护重要的人。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_dialog_pendant","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/46/3yw4qpsmm6prcnkq3r4hxcjy8wklvk4.mp3"},{"title":"有什么想要分享…","desc":"泡茶是一件看似简单实则费心的事情，茶叶的品质、茶水的温度、冲泡的次数，只有所有的变量都控制恰当，才能泡出味道最纯正的茶。要来一杯吗？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_dialog_share_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/5c/bhzuve18dhnwepezyjx20wya2fn9doa.mp3"},{"title":"感兴趣的见闻…","desc":"小动物们也会表达自己的情绪，如果仔细聆听的话就会知道它们现在的状态。对于小猫来说，「喵~」比起「喵喵喵！」，前者心情更好，这时候不管怎么摸它都不会逃走哦。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_pref_gift_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d8/a0uci7ihjxhje205afjbyalaz2n6kie.mp3"},{"title":"关于林尼·默契","desc":"我和林尼一直都待在一起，我们即使不开口也能明白对方的想法，所以单独相处时，他会比平时要安静。你问我他说的哪些是真话，哪些是假话？其实我都知道，但这是最高保密事项。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_teammate_lyney_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c4/sjo0rkaqve30lw6csv5gx5ttm55je6x.mp3"},{"title":"关于林尼·担忧","desc":"林尼平时总是自信不疑，做起事来游刃有余，或者说，他让所有人都以为他一直如此，所以在遇到麻烦的时候，他也总会想要一个人完美地解决…如果遇到这种情况，还请多多关照他吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_teammate_lyney_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/ca/8y1gqiiuhfth94vsupgbkiph7sl6tfc.mp3"},{"title":"关于菲米尼…","desc":"他是个细腻温柔的孩子，却有些喜欢妄自菲薄…或许是和之前的经历有关吧。有时候他给我的感觉就像是林尼的反面…既然两边都是我的家人，意见不合时，我会负责弥合分歧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_teammate_freminet_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/cd/t9sqhw6kz48rawx1llpvs2a3l3j4lj1.mp3"},{"title":"关于「父亲」…","desc":"「父亲」表达爱意的方式…不一定能被每个人接受，但就是因为有「父亲」在，家…才得以为家。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_teammate_arlecchino_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/cf/p03m8ndhq63ay2tft722jzanzteo5ad.mp3"},{"title":"关于那维莱特…","desc":"最高审判官总给我一种奇怪的疏离感，明明言行谈吐都很谦和…还是说，他也不怎么喜欢跟人打交道呢？不过他和美露莘们说话的时候，倒是很亲切。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_teammate_neuvillette_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/09/ryae5bduuzqjv0nmkej5d9tfvoiu0k3.mp3"},{"title":"关于芙宁娜…","desc":"芙宁娜大人的行为太难解读了，也观察不出什么有用的情报，总觉得她一举一动像是在扮演不同的人…不愧是神明，不能用普通人的角度来揣测。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_teammate_furina_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/3d/ifl5meqn8v4yumgjut07d078ih9snpj.mp3"},{"title":"关于娜维娅…","desc":"虽然是「刺玫会」的新会长，作风却像邻居家爱管闲事的大姐姐呢。要是「家」里真有这么一位姐姐就好了…啊，这话好像不太合适…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_teammate_navia_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/3f/0032nqqu4xw8wpkyv1dmaqaxvttqnea.mp3"},{"title":"关于克洛琳德…","desc":"我曾经奉命观摩过她的决斗，仅仅是从旁观察，就能感觉到令人害怕的寒意…真不知道在决斗场上直面她会是什么感觉…嗯，希望这辈子都不要知道。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_teammate_clorinde_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f7/3t0fwba3gdsufijjb310uec0zl0220f.mp3"},{"title":"关于千织…","desc":"我跟林尼的演出服都是请她定制的。有一次林尼用小刀表演魔术，不小心划到了袖口，后来被她数落了好久…真可怕。幸好每次去她店里，都可以躲到林尼背后。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_teammate_chiori_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/10/4fjx6vq0fo2uhlia728dto2irhr1ybf.mp3"},{"title":"关于夏洛蒂…","desc":"呃…我后来也被她抓着采访过几次。明明被林尼拒绝了那么多次，真是毅力可嘉…可惜她准备了这么多问题，我一个也没回答。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_teammate_charlotte_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/aa/1hyryz85f2lgs1420n6g9fc3ipf75dd.mp3"},{"title":"关于艾梅莉埃…","desc":"这位香水设计师小姐的作品热门到需要凌晨排队抢购。但我对香水的味道太敏感，打出喷嚏来就太失礼了…所以只能绕着走。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_teammate_emilie_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/82/abu5iss4m1ns0ao7eiayo6egj81zr6h.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解琳妮特·其一","desc":"如果要解释魔术，就会失去看表演的乐趣，人际关系也是这样，想了解我的话，不妨一点点收集信息，拼凑答案吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_friendship_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/8d/ffm8xv4imq1igqid3bza5t6lln2kzbp.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解琳妮特·其二","desc":"人是很复杂的生物，即便不是有意欺瞒，也会不自觉地隐藏自己的真实一面。虽然我总能注意到一些「多余」的细节，但除非必要情况，我不会拆穿别人的伪装。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_friendship_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f6/tseze4f4ct1p1mrfajxmdmn5optcgqe.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解琳妮特·其三","desc":"魔术曾经是我和林尼的谋生手段，现在更多是一种便利的社会身份，以魔术表演的名义，我们就能融入这座城市，成为家的「眼睛」。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_friendship_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/66/81wy718h6ccchdhxba51ezk5j36migt.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解琳妮特·其四","desc":"在来到新家之前，我和林尼一直到处流浪，经历了许多艰难和危险的状况。从那时起，我便习惯时刻注意一切危险的迹象，也逐渐学会解读他人的所思所想。好在，如今我们拥有了一个安身之所。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_friendship_04","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/2e/cdqynukjtu5hm5cq7dcbtkh53iepfea.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解琳妮特·其五","desc":"建立人际关系是一种赌局，无论掌握多少信息，都难以预测人心的变化。一直以来我习惯待在安全的距离，但如果是你的话…我愿意承担输掉的风险。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_friendship_05","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c4/g8esvq8bjqib7y1fzv5p7my7gaae40l.mp3"},{"title":"琳妮特的爱好…","desc":"人的精神和弓弦一样，如果一直绷得太紧，就会有断裂的风险。所以在工作之外，我会做一些能放松神经的事情，比如泡茶、喂猫、发呆。平时心情越是平静，就越能应对将来的危险。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_pref_hobby","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/7c/4x1t8195eyzjjfnxam8usmmq8ztjyhv.mp3"},{"title":"琳妮特的烦恼…","desc":"我不是很习惯操作机械，一旦不注意就会出现意外状况，有一次在雨天搞坏了烘干机…还好菲米尼很擅长修理东西。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_dialog_annoyed_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/99/6ml14dme06nzeq0gca5vbye6azxx42e.mp3"},{"title":"喜欢的食物…","desc":"撬开贝壳，在新鲜贝肉上挤点柠檬汁，连餐盘都不需要了。完美。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_pref_foodLike","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/52/r8bjipztsuvsfe6lyyoxm5rjlh518wk.mp3"},{"title":"讨厌的食物…","desc":"调料过重的食物，不行。食材就是要保留原始的口味才好。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_pref_foodDislike","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d4/qq3temv4nksge074rqyfgavcfh184tu.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其一","desc":"好吃，配方我已经记下来了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_spice_pref_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/bc/lpti08xxyavjsmbtf9299n71cxo1jb9.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其二","desc":"谢谢招待。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_spice_normal_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/da/qlt3l5nqixx39tmoukpl776qcnsqjaq.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其三","desc":"调料的比例，再斟酌一下吧？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_spice_dislike_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/90/t5tocj6mwgiw4cr8ql8z7a25oheylet.mp3"},{"title":"生日…","desc":"生日快乐！卡片给你…这不是贺卡，当然没写东西了。写下你想要的礼物，放进我的帽子里，不管是什么，都会为你准备的。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_pref_birthday_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/87/aqe256ljo8admajoj9jppamtu8qkof9.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·起","desc":"感知更敏锐了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_starUp_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/05/kb47mm6wvuc27mtdb0afprbeqoxz090.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·承","desc":"思考速度…继续上升。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_starUp_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/3d/e1xbthr2932lu3b6x2oddsuxlb3beip.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·转","desc":"看到了，胜利的条件。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_starUp_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/e1/j5ztuojh09mgjg8r67wxuyv7rrp5gjp.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·合","desc":"我竟然能获得这样的力量…这样我也能站在你的身前了吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_starUp_04","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/9f/emp3srqniol9xsgppndamgi7usr41x7.mp3"}],"actionLines":[{"title":"元素战技·其一","desc":"一点把戏。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_battle_skill1_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/59/09ltxr1nmihihotgds9dsdiy58ddjy7.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其二","desc":"在这里。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_battle_skill1_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/e3/tq4uticayjwlslvtd99h8ay7t12tdkz.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其三","desc":"惊喜。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_battle_skill1_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/20/fv6pws37ru8n76e2rfa4urkhwr602w5.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其一","desc":"魔术开场。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_battle_skill3_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f8/iqcjzsmhlm5jz8xs3q1wowr85rzvv7n.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其二","desc":"来点灯光。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_battle_skill3_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/b8/o252a550q1pb75ii9qh7h4iow44sf26.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其三","desc":"请看这边。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_battle_skill3_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/ba/0b0g4m61nfp8t7ee9gx94uycshsybqy.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其一","desc":"宝物的气息。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_chest_open_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/fd/h3gcfr9dipxkmirxqcw9y8tn2p2dtjd.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其二","desc":"不出所料。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_chest_open_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/02/mafxw4eo9i3udzq1rv8zcuho3bkbuu1.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其三","desc":"轻松到手。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_chest_open_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/0b/pjupfi36aq2a66xz52yo96xvxxshjg2.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其一","desc":"保持冷静。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_life_less30_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/4c/kw30c3hqmhal45l6mhr30nht69ck0m1.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其二","desc":"我得集中精神。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_life_less30_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d4/jo8svstgsowdq8qv4kakqo2cs4o0kud.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其三","desc":"启动应敌模式…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_life_less30_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c0/nz3l70n1ah1mwpyqk8my8yv4h4qclsx.mp3"},{"title":"同伴生命值低·其一","desc":"快退后。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_life_less30_teammate_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/88/96qjqn9617q8g539sb8fazp7xghtq8w.mp3"},{"title":"同伴生命值低·其二","desc":"我来吸引火力。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_life_less30_teammate_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/33/mm7f7lf1gx2ofwwr2mfuljhaslppele.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其一","desc":"我…看漏了什么…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_life_die_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/66/nybs0uvsyv45pfjw44k2tjt8v1lypro.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其二","desc":"魔术失误了…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_life_die_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/fa/lmjqi7tv4te44c0h3mzb9mw527p9fyw.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其三","desc":"林尼…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_life_die_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/bf/hfazu13tke6ovgllodkgd5du6t4maz4.mp3"},{"title":"普通受击·其一","desc":"还好。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_battle_hit_L_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f7/hg73716yeaswvc7gmladnzwbgt7jcye.mp3"},{"title":"重受击·其一","desc":"啊，没躲开。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_lynette/vo_lynette_battle_hit_H_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/13/9509z5fgrqtau0wnilq3ijjmq34ick9.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其一","desc":"魔术要开演了吗？","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_lynette_teamJoin_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/7d/2zcyrlbs1l7y8098xtsusbbodka24g0.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其二","desc":"下午茶时间到了。","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_lynette_teamJoin_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/3d/0unwndno42xboro5j2lcyx4nba4bs6m.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其三","desc":"你带路吧。","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_lynette_teamJoin_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/0f/flf6i6g4y9ylmfqtsp9ucx12j6pkm7b.mp3"}],"cardArt":"assets/characters/10000083-card.webp","fullArt":"assets/characters/10000083-full.webp","fullArtWidth":977,"fullArtHeight":917}